{"ID":"20230926145135-sf8enpj","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230926145135-sf8enpj","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926145135-sf8enpj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926145139-efrkznh\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926145139-fdv5m12\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926145139-fdv5m12\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:83,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:83\u0026#125;","title":"【甘草干姜茯苓白术汤】【肾着汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20230926145139"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230926145139-efrkznh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230926145139-efrkznh","updated":"20230926145139"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"组成：甘草二两（炙）、白术二两、干姜四两、茯苓四两；"}]},{"ID":"20230926145139-u9mwx1m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230926145139-u9mwx1m","updated":"20230926145139"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右四味，以水五升，煮取三升，去滓，温服一升，日三服。"}]},{"ID":"20230926145139-fdv5m12","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230926145139-fdv5m12","updated":"20230926145139"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【桂林本5.47】寒病，骨痛，阴痹，腹胀，腰痛，大便难，肩背颈项引痛，脉沉而迟，此寒邪干肾也，桂枝加葛根汤主之；其着也则两腘痛，甘草干姜茯苓白术汤主之（也叫肾着汤）。"}]}]}